# The repository is a C++ project that also carries a Dart package. Only the
# package belongs in a published archive: the station, the native tests and the
# build files are for people building the station, not for consumers of the
# client. Without this file the whole tree is published, which is how the dry
# run came to contain CMakeLists.txt and sixteen C++ sources.
/CMakeLists.txt
/src/
/tests/
/docs/
/tool/
/analysis_options.yaml
/build/
